<fw type="header" place="top">             <hi rendition="#b">4) Carl <hi rendition="#aq">IV.</hi> &#x2014; Sigism. 1356-1414.</hi>           </fw>           <lb/>
<p>Ein in &#x017F;einer Art einziges Haus, das um<note place="right"><hi rendition="#aq">XIII.</hi></note><lb/>
